# Run output: heavy artifacts (agent streams, gate logs) stay local.
# bench.json scorecards ARE tracked — they are the dataset the results
# dashboard (and its GitHub Pages deploy) renders.
results/**
!results/*/
!results/*/bench.json
# The agent's final self-report (few KB) — feeds the dashboard's Agent notes
# on deployed builds, where the full stream is absent.
!results/*/agent-report.md
# Forensic breakdown of where the run's time and cost went (from stream mining).
!results/*/time-analysis.md
